@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

actor 前端用户 as front
participant 业务系统 as biz
participant 认证授权系统 as auth
participant 网关 as gate

autonumber

== 用户授权 ==

auth -> biz: 周期性（120s）发放 ticket
front -> biz: 请求获取 sign 和 customerId
biz -> biz: 基于 ticket 生成 sign
biz -> front: 返回 ak, channelId, customerId, sign
front -> gate: 请求接口 /auth/channel 接口获取 accessToken
note over front, gate
携带 ak, channelId, customerId, sign 参数
后续用户侧在 websocket 建立连接和 http 请求中，都需要携带 accessToken
end note
gate -> auth: 转发请求
auth -> auth: 签名认证，然后发放 accessToken
auth -> gate: 返回 accessToken
gate -> front: 返回 accessToken 给前端

@enduml